{"applicationId":"fd6a396e6d214afc8e72ed508724e213","applicationName":"【模】考勤管理","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>模板介绍</title>\n    <script>\n        window.parent.document.getElementsByClassName('customPage')[0].style = \"overflow:hidden\"\n    </script>\n    <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"styleSheet\" href=\"./index.css\" />\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <div id=\"app\">\n        <div class=\"Wrap\">\n            <h1 class=\"h_s\"> 模板介绍--考勤管理</h1>\n\n            <!-- 1.业务流程图-->\n            <div class=\"inList\">\n                <h2> 1.业务流程图 </h2>\n                <img src=\"https://dsc.jsthqc.com/api/v1/fdn-storage/oss/files/download?uri=9134167922923ba09ad18872b2b1246e/material/fd6a396e6d214afc8e72ed508724e213/应用说明/考勤管理业务流程图.png\"\n                    alt=\"\" />\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 2.应用价值-->\n            <div class=\"inList\">\n                <h2> 2.应用价值</h2>\n                <p>1.针对公司的员工信息进行出差考勤管理，对外出、出差、请假做相应的申请、审批和记录。</p>\n                <p>2.输出考勤报表请假、出差、外出、迟到等统计。</p>\n\n            </div>\n            <!-- 2.应用价值-->\n            <div class=\"inList\">\n                <h2> 3.功能描述</h2>\n\n                <h3> 1>员工信息 </h3>\n                <p>①记录员工的工作年限、可休年假、已休年假、剩余年假等信息</p>\n                <img src=\"https://dsc.jsthqc.com/api/v1/fdn-storage/oss/files/download?uri=9134167922923ba09ad18872b2b1246e/material/fd6a396e6d214afc8e72ed508724e213/应用说明/员工信息.png\"\n                    alt=\"\" />\n                 \n                    \n                <h3>2>出差审批</h3>\n                <p>①记录员工出差审批信息</p>\n                <img src=\"https://dsc.jsthqc.com/api/v1/fdn-storage/oss/files/download?uri=9134167922923ba09ad18872b2b1246e/material/fd6a396e6d214afc8e72ed508724e213/应用说明/出差审批.png\"\n                    alt=\"\" />\n\n                <h3>3>出差日志</h3>\n                <p>①展示员工出差的日志等相关信息</p>\n                <img src=\"https://dsc.jsthqc.com/api/v1/fdn-storage/oss/files/download?uri=9134167922923ba09ad18872b2b1246e/material/fd6a396e6d214afc8e72ed508724e213/应用说明/出差日志.png\"\n                    alt=\"\" />\n                    \n                 <h3>4>外出审批</h3>\n                <p>①记录员工外出审批信息</p>\n                <img src=\"https://dsc.jsthqc.com/api/v1/fdn-storage/oss/files/download?uri=9134167922923ba09ad18872b2b1246e/material/fd6a396e6d214afc8e72ed508724e213/应用说明/外出审批.png\"\n                    alt=\"\" />\n                    \n                <h3>5>请假审批</h3>\n                <p>①记录员工请假审批信息</p>\n                <img src=\"https://dsc.jsthqc.com/api/v1/fdn-storage/oss/files/download?uri=9134167922923ba09ad18872b2b1246e/material/fd6a396e6d214afc8e72ed508724e213/应用说明/请假审批.png\"\n                    alt=\"\" />\n                    \n                 <h3>6>考勤日报</h3>\n                <p>①记录员工考勤日报信息</p>\n                <img src=\"https://dsc.jsthqc.com/api/v1/fdn-storage/oss/files/download?uri=9134167922923ba09ad18872b2b1246e/material/fd6a396e6d214afc8e72ed508724e213/应用说明/考勤日报.png\"\n                    alt=\"\" />\n                    \n                   <h3>7>考勤月报</h3>\n                <p>①记录员工考勤月报信息</p>\n                <img src=\"https://dsc.jsthqc.com/api/v1/fdn-storage/oss/files/download?uri=9134167922923ba09ad18872b2b1246e/material/fd6a396e6d214afc8e72ed508724e213/应用说明/考勤月报.png\"\n                    alt=\"\" />\n                    \n                     <h3>8>考勤申诉</h3>\n                <p>①记录员工考勤日报异常申诉后的信息</p>\n                <img src=\"https://dsc.jsthqc.com/api/v1/fdn-storage/oss/files/download?uri=9134167922923ba09ad18872b2b1246e/material/fd6a396e6d214afc8e72ed508724e213/应用说明/考勤申诉.png\"\n                    alt=\"\" />\n                    \n                   <h3>9>报表中心</h3>\n                <p>①记录员工考勤日报和日报报表信息</p>\n                <img src=\"https://dsc.jsthqc.com/api/v1/fdn-storage/oss/files/download?uri=9134167922923ba09ad18872b2b1246e/material/fd6a396e6d214afc8e72ed508724e213/应用说明/日报报表.png\"\n                    alt=\"\" />\n                    \n                 <img src=\"https://dsc.jsthqc.com/api/v1/fdn-storage/oss/files/download?uri=9134167922923ba09ad18872b2b1246e/material/fd6a396e6d214afc8e72ed508724e213/应用说明/月报报表.png\"\n                    alt=\"\" />\n                    \n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n\n</html>","createTime":1765854149000,"createUserId":"1889706623013949441","fileType":"html","hiddenCode":"78528403882545d3b2302432955fa5da","id":"b60661887db44c08952d1d5817e8257b","modelCode":"","modelId":"a416d46902eb4a3dab9bc811291fd3c1","modelType":"CUSTOM_PAGE","name":"index.html","tenantId":"9134167922923ba09ad18872b2b1246e","updateTime":1765854149000,"versionType":"DEVELOP"}